    {
      "id": "78b5759c",
      "name": "Fleet Coordinated Takeoff and Formation (5 Drones) 1",
      "content": "Five-drone coordination exercise: Relief UAV 02, Relief UAV 07, Relief UAV 05, Relief UAV 08, and Relief UAV 04 take off together to 21 meters altitude, then hold formation at positions (468, 372, 21), (678, 334, 21), (812, 462, 21), (686, 563, 21), and (531, 593, 21) respectively for synchronized operation. Then all five drones move north for 117m, and next move east for 99m. Each drone must complete the specified directional movements (north 117m, then east 99m) regardless of starting position - if obstacles block the path, drones should adjust position as needed to complete the full directed distance in each heading.",
      "content_aliases": [
        "Coordinate Relief UAV 02, Relief UAV 07, Relief UAV 05, Relief UAV 08, and Relief UAV 04: ascend together to 21 meters, establish pentagon formation at positions (468, 372, 21), (678, 334, 21), (812, 462, 21), (686, 563, 21), and (531, 593, 21) respectively, then execute coordinated movement north 117m followed by east 99m. All drones must complete the full directional distance (north 117m, east 99m) from their respective positions, adjusting as needed to avoid obstacles.",
        "Five-drone formation drill: launch Relief UAV 02, Relief UAV 07, Relief UAV 05, Relief UAV 08, and Relief UAV 04 to altitude 21m, hold stations at (468, 372, 21), (678, 334, 21), (812, 462, 21), (686, 563, 21), and (531, 593, 21) respectively, then shift north by 117 meters and east by 99 meters in synchronized operation. Each drone travels the specified distance in each direction regardless of obstacles encountered.",
        "Execute synchronized operation with Relief UAV 02, Relief UAV 07, Relief UAV 05, Relief UAV 08, Relief UAV 04: take off reaching 21 meters height, maintain formation at coordinates (468, 372, 21), (678, 334, 21), (812, 462, 21), (686, 563, 21), and (531, 593, 21) respectively, then proceed north for 117m and subsequently east for 99m together, with each drone completing the full directed movements by repositioning around obstacles if necessary.",
        "Five-drone coordinated maneuver: Relief UAV 02, Relief UAV 07, Relief UAV 05, Relief UAV 08, and Relief UAV 04 lift off to 21m elevation, hold formation positions at (468, 372, 21), (678, 334, 21), (812, 462, 21), (686, 563, 21), and (531, 593, 21) respectively, then travel north 117 meters and east 99 meters in sequence. The specified directional distances must be achieved by each drone, adapting position to circumvent any obstacles."
      ],
